{"id":"267d66ca73221e94","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-stage-comparison.md","title":"累积归纳的阶段比较关系","display":"df-stage-comparison — 累积归纳的阶段比较关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-stage-comparison","aliases":["18-df-stage-comparison"],"display":"df-stage-comparison — 累积归纳的阶段比较关系","depends_on":["[[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]","[[18-df-inductive-norm]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"§13.2 equations (13.2)–(13.7)","source_printed_pages":"336–337","source_pdf_pages":"344–345","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"已核 (13.3)–(13.7) 的全部所列证明；(13.2) 为关系定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-stage-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-stage-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stage-comparison — 累积归纳的阶段比较关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1617e481ba305017\" href=\"?note=1617e481ba305017\" title=\"18-df-nonmonotone-stages\">18-df-nonmonotone-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03fd31ede57cedbe\" href=\"?note=03fd31ede57cedbe\" title=\"18-df-inductive-norm\">18-df-inductive-norm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2 equations (13.2)–(13.7)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"336–337"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"344–345"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"已核 (13.3)–(13.7) 的全部所列证明；(13.2) 为关系定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\omega_1\">\\(\\Omega=\\omega_1\\)</span>；阶段取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1617e481ba305017\" href=\"?note=1617e481ba305017\" title=\"18-df-nonmonotone-stages\">18-df-nonmonotone-stages</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma,r_\\Gamma\">\\(P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma,r_\\Gamma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03fd31ede57cedbe\" href=\"?note=03fd31ede57cedbe\" title=\"18-df-inductive-norm\">18-df-inductive-norm</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span> 是下式定义的非严格与严格阶段比较关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\">\\(x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\prec_\\Gamma y\">\\(x\\prec_\\Gamma y\\)</span> 为相应的中缀缩写。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in\\omega\">\\(x,y,z\\in\\omega\\)</span>。集合论有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 仅作为关系的元素，不是算术语言中的数码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_\\Gamma&amp;:=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^2\\mid\n\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\Omega\\;(x\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\\land y\\notin\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha})\\},\\\\\nS_\\Gamma&amp;:=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^2\\mid\n\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\Omega\\;(x\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\\land y\\notin\\Gamma^\\alpha)\\},\\\\\nx\\preceq_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R_\\Gamma,\\\\\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S_\\Gamma.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_\\Gamma&amp;:=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^2\\mid\n\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\Omega\\;(x\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\\land y\\notin\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha})\\},\\\\\nS_\\Gamma&amp;:=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^2\\mid\n\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\Omega\\;(x\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\\land y\\notin\\Gamma^\\alpha)\\},\\\\\nx\\preceq_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R_\\Gamma,\\\\\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S_\\Gamma.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nx\\preceq_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land r_\\Gamma(x)\\le r_\\Gamma(y),\\\\\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land r_\\Gamma(x)&lt;r_\\Gamma(y),\\\\\nx\\preceq_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land(y\\notin P_\\Gamma\\lor\\neg(y\\prec_\\Gamma x)),\\\\\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land(y\\notin P_\\Gamma\\lor\\neg(y\\preceq_\\Gamma x)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nx\\preceq_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land r_\\Gamma(x)\\le r_\\Gamma(y),\\\\\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land r_\\Gamma(x)&lt;r_\\Gamma(y),\\\\\nx\\preceq_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land(y\\notin P_\\Gamma\\lor\\neg(y\\prec_\\Gamma x)),\\\\\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y&amp;\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land(y\\notin P_\\Gamma\\lor\\neg(y\\preceq_\\Gamma x)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall y\\in P_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\\}&amp;=\\Gamma^{\\nu_\\Gamma(y)},\\\\\n\\forall y\\in P_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\prec_\\Gamma y\\}&amp;=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\nu_\\Gamma(y)},\\\\\n\\forall y\\in\\omega\\setminus P_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\\}\n&amp;=\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\prec_\\Gamma y\\}=P_\\Gamma.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall y\\in P_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\\}&amp;=\\Gamma^{\\nu_\\Gamma(y)},\\\\\n\\forall y\\in P_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\prec_\\Gamma y\\}&amp;=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\nu_\\Gamma(y)},\\\\\n\\forall y\\in\\omega\\setminus P_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\\}\n&amp;=\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\prec_\\Gamma y\\}=P_\\Gamma.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y\\lor\nx\\in\\Gamma(\\{z\\in\\omega\\mid z\\prec_\\Gamma y\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y\\lor\nx\\in\\Gamma(\\{z\\in\\omega\\mid z\\prec_\\Gamma y\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 (13.2)–(13.7)。非严格关系用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\">\\(y\\notin\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\\)</span>，严格关系用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\Gamma^\\alpha\">\\(y\\notin\\Gamma^\\alpha\\)</span>；两者不能交换。关系是整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 上的关系：已经入层的元素严格先于全部未入层元素，未入层元素则没有以自身为第一坐标的比较关系。</p>\n<p>已核原书所列证明。累积性给出：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\">\\(x\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P_\\Gamma\">\\(x\\in P_\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_\\Gamma(x)\\le\\alpha\">\\(r_\\Gamma(x)\\le\\alpha\\)</span>。据此直接得到范数比较式及各截面公式。对已入层的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，最后一式是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{\\nu_\\Gamma(y)}=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\nu_\\Gamma(y)}\\cup\\Gamma(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\nu_\\Gamma(y)})\">\\(\\Gamma^{\\nu_\\Gamma(y)}=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\nu_\\Gamma(y)}\\cup\\Gamma(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\nu_\\Gamma(y)})\\)</span>；对未入层的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，两个截面都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\Gamma\">\\(P_\\Gamma\\)</span>，而停滞保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(P_\\Gamma)\\subseteq P_\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma(P_\\Gamma)\\subseteq P_\\Gamma\\)</span>，故同样成立。使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\)</span> 的集合大小见证与原书全序数见证等价，因为所有成员在闭包序数之前入层。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-nonmonotone-stages","status":"resolved","id":"1617e481ba305017","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-inductive-norm","status":"resolved","id":"03fd31ede57cedbe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-inductive-norm]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-nonmonotone-stages","status":"resolved","id":"1617e481ba305017","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$，$\\Omega=\\omega_1$；阶段取 [[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]，$P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma,r_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-inductive-norm]]。$R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma\\subseteq\\omega^2$ 是下式定义的非严格与严格阶段比较关系；$x\\preceq_\\Gamma y$、$x\\prec_\\Gamma y$ 为相应的中缀缩写。$x,y,z\\in\\omega$。集合论有序对 $\\langle x,y\\rangle$ 仅作为关系的元素，不是算术语言中的数码。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-inductive-norm","status":"resolved","id":"03fd31ede57cedbe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$，$\\Omega=\\omega_1$；阶段取 [[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]，$P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma,r_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-inductive-norm]]。$R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma\\subseteq\\omega^2$ 是下式定义的非严格与严格阶段比较关系；$x\\preceq_\\Gamma y$、$x\\prec_\\Gamma y$ 为相应的中缀缩写。$x,y,z\\in\\omega$。集合论有序对 $\\langle x,y\\rangle$ 仅作为关系的元素，不是算术语言中的数码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega=\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma,r_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma\\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"x\\preceq_\\Gamma y","display":false},{"tex":"x\\prec_\\Gamma y","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_\\Gamma&:=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^2\\mid\n\\exists\\alpha<\\Omega\\;(x\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\\land y\\notin\\Gamma^{<\\alpha})\\},\\\\\nS_\\Gamma&:=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^2\\mid\n\\exists\\alpha<\\Omega\\;(x\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\\land y\\notin\\Gamma^\\alpha)\\},\\\\\nx\\preceq_\\Gamma y&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R_\\Gamma,\\\\\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S_\\Gamma.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nx\\preceq_\\Gamma y&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land r_\\Gamma(x)\\le r_\\Gamma(y),\\\\\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land r_\\Gamma(x)<r_\\Gamma(y),\\\\\nx\\preceq_\\Gamma y&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land(y\\notin P_\\Gamma\\lor\\neg(y\\prec_\\Gamma x)),\\\\\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y&\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\in P_\\Gamma\\land(y\\notin P_\\Gamma\\lor\\neg(y\\preceq_\\Gamma x)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall y\\in P_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\\}&=\\Gamma^{\\nu_\\Gamma(y)},\\\\\n\\forall y\\in P_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\prec_\\Gamma y\\}&=\\Gamma^{<\\nu_\\Gamma(y)},\\\\\n\\forall y\\in\\omega\\setminus P_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\\}\n&=\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid x\\prec_\\Gamma y\\}=P_\\Gamma.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"x\\preceq_\\Gamma y\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nx\\prec_\\Gamma y\\lor\nx\\in\\Gamma(\\{z\\in\\omega\\mid z\\prec_\\Gamma y\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"y\\notin\\Gamma^{<\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"y\\notin\\Gamma^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in P_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"r_\\Gamma(x)\\le\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^{\\nu_\\Gamma(y)}=\\Gamma^{<\\nu_\\Gamma(y)}\\cup\\Gamma(\\Gamma^{<\\nu_\\Gamma(y)})","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(P_\\Gamma)\\subseteq P_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":3426,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-stage-comparison]]"},{"id":"a2393ecde85db745","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$。$P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-inductive-norm]]；$R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-stage-comparison]]；$\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega$ 与 $\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-prewellordering]]。量化的候选 $P$ 是 $\\omega$ 的子集，$R,S$ 是 $\\omega$ 上的二元关系；不假定 $\\Gamma$ 单调。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-stage-comparison]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-stage-comparison]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-stage-comparison|18-df-stage-comparison]]"}],"outgoing":["1617e481ba305017","03fd31ede57cedbe"]}